Amazon FinSpace is an AWS analytics platform that helps financial organizations store, manage, and analyze large amounts of financial data in one place for faster insights and decision-making
amazon kinesis : real time data processing 
Amazon Amazon Data Firehose is a service that automatically collects live streaming data and sends it to storage or analytics systems without much manual work
Amazon Amazon Managed Service for Apache Flink is a cloud service used to process streaming data in real time using Apache Flink, without managing servers manually.
Amazon Amazon Kinesis Data Streams is a service that collects and stores live streaming data continuously in real time.
Amazon Amazon Kinesis Video Streams is a service used to collect, store, and process live video streams from cameras and devices.
Amazon Amazon OpenSearch Service is a cloud service used to store, search, analyze, and visualize large amounts of data quickly.
Amazon OpenSearch Serverless is a cloud service used to search, analyze, and visualize large amounts of data without managing servers.
Amazon Redshift is a cloud-based data warehouse service used to store and analyze huge amounts of business data very quickly.
Amazon Redshift Serverless is a cloud analytics service that helps companies analyze large amounts of data without managing servers or infrastructure.
Amazon (AWS) is a cloud computing platform that provides services like storage, databases, servers, networking, AI, and analytics over the internet.
Amazon AWS Clean Rooms is a service that allows different companies to securely analyze data together without directly sharing their original private data.
Amazon AWS Data Exchange is a service that allows companies to easily buy, sell, and share datasets in the cloud.
Amazon AWS Data Pipeline is a service used to automatically move and process data between different systems.
Amazon AWS Entity Resolution is a cloud service that helps companies identify and match records that actually belong to the same person, customer, or business — even when the information looks different.
Amazon AWS Glue is a service used to collect, clean, transform, and prepare data for analytics and reporting.
Amazon AWS Lake Formation is a service that helps companies collect, organize, secure, and manage large amounts of data in one central place called a data lake.
Amazon Amazon Managed Streaming for Apache Kafka (Amazon MSK) is a service used to collect and process large amounts of real-time streaming data using Apache Kafka, without managing the infrastructure manually.
Application Integration means connecting different applications or systems so they can share data and work together smoothly.

